AltoMultiChainlinkLendingOracle::getPrice()
├── given chainlinkNodes array is empty
│   └── it should revert with AltoMultiChainlinkLendingOracleInvalidInput
├── given chainlinkNodes array has one node
│       ├── it should return price in first node's outDecimals
│       └── it should apply chainlink node conversion correctly
└── given chainlinkNodes array has multiple nodes
        ├── it should return price in last node's outDecimals
        └── it should chain all conversions correctly
